OL,3,GNEWSAFears city's cultural district
OL,4,Afaces wipeout if rail expansion goes
OL,5,Aahead
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor fans of music and arts in
OL,8,FBirmingham, Digbeth is area which
OL,9,Finspires a lot of positive feelings as
OL,10,Fthe graffiti-covered old industrial
OL,11,Fheartland that is home to the city's
OL,12,Fmain music, nightclub and art scene.
OL,14,FBut Digbeth is facing an uncertain
OL,15,Ffuture.
OL,17,FNightclubs and community venues in the
OL,18,Farea are warning that a major railway
OL,19,Fproject could lead to a "complete
OL,20,Fcultural wipe out" of the bohemian
OL,21,Fdistrict..
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
