OL,3,GNEWSAFears city's cultural district
OL,4,Afaces wipeout if rail expansion goes
OL,5,Aahead
OL,6,
OL,7,FDozens of independent music venues and
OL,8,Fcommunity spaces could be demolished if
OL,9,Fa huge redevelopment project, the
OL,10,F#1.75bn Midlands Rail Hub between
OL,11,FBirmingham Moor Street and Bordesley
OL,12,Fstations, goes ahead.
